Question 4: What is the name of the file that defaced the imreallynotbatman.com website? Please submit only the name of the file with extension?
Answer guidance: For example "notepad.exe" or "favicon.ico"
Solution: 
1. Find the webserver through destination ip when filtering imreallynotbatman.com since that is where we send requests to.
2. We then use the destination ip we just found of 192.168.250.70 as the source ip and remove the imreallynotbatman.com filter and specify GET to see which file was downloaded. 
3. We see that poisonivy-is-coming-for-you-batman.jpeg is the file downloaded through a quick search which lets us complete the level.

Writeup: This was really hard for me. I needed a hint and the destination ip and source ip switching weren't obvious nor intuitive to me. But still fun to tinker with searching.
Needed sometime to understand the meaning of deface and filter what I was looking for.

